{"parentUuid":"e5075653-1350-466e-a3d4-37529bbeecdb","isSidechain":true,"promptId":"9af44ced-bc96-4c0c-851c-b7a4d67027a3","agentId":"ae75cc2fe613b3186","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01Emi1HKXevtTiA5JE143QPa","type":"tool_result","content":" codex-mock/e2e/001_hooks/hook_records_test.go      | 40 ++++++++++++++++++++++\n codex-mock/internal/runner/tool_host.go            |  5 +--\n codex-mock/internal/runner/turn_host.go            |  3 +-\n codex-mock/internal/session/file.go                |  6 +++-\n .../hook-output-transcript-records.yaml            |  6 ++--\n 5 files changed, 51 insertions(+), 9 deletions(-)\n      - claude-mock/snapshots/runs/hookerrors\n      - claude-mock/snapshots/runs/hookmix\n      - claude-mock/snapshots/runs/stops\n      - claude-mock/snapshots/runs/bgbash\n      - claude-mock/snapshots/runs/hook-timeout\n  codex:\n    docs:\n      - https://developers.openai.com/codex/hooks#userpromptsubmit\n      - https://developers.openai.com/codex/hooks#posttooluse\n    runs:\n      - codex-mock/snapshots/runs/hook-exit-codes\n      - codex-mock/snapshots/runs/hook-timeout\n      - codex-mock/snapshots/runs/posttool-block\n      - codex-mock/snapshots/runs/prompt-blocked\n    deviations:\n      - adr: capability-grounding\n        statement: >-\n          Codex records less than the statement says: a hook that fails\n          without blocking (exit 1, a failure at SessionStart) and a hook\n          stopped by its timeout leave no record, a prompt a hook blocks leaves\n          no record of the reason (runs/prompt-blocked), and the end of a turn that\n          ran hooks gets no summary record (recorded: runs/hook-exit-codes,\n          runs/hook-timeout). What it records is the context a hook adds (a\n          developer message), a block of a tool call (that call's result) and\n          the reason a stop hook blocks with (a hook_prompt user message), and\n          the mock records just those.\n  cursor:\n    supported: false\n    reason: Cursor's transcript holds only user and assistant messages, so nothing a hook output, blocked, cancelled or added is recorded there.\n    runs:\n      - cursor-mock/snapshots/runs/hook-exit-codes\n      - cursor-mock/snapshots/runs/additional-context","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"741e74df-439e-4980-9c95-39faa27e11a9","timestamp":"2026-10-03T14:55:38.359Z","sourceToolAssistantUUID":"e5075653-1350-466e-a3d4-37529bbeecdb","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"/Users/nsviridenko/ws/sloprail/harness-mocks/.claude/worktrees/agent-ae75cc2fe613b3186","sessionId":"f103aecd-8ff6-40a5-ad21-f5bd02338666","version":"2.1.286","gitBranch":"worktree-agent-a513ce3b392834fe0"}
